Short answer: it can't be done.

PersonalAlpha emulates a Turbochannel-based architecture, the DEC
3000.  There is absolutely NO possibility of running V5.1A or V5.1B on
a 3000, because Turbochannel support was removed from the kernel in
V5.1A (although the platform was officially desupported in V5.1, the
code was still present in that version).   Unless PersonalAlpha is
changed at some point in the future to emulate a newer system, trying
to run V5.1A or V5.1B on it is just a waste of time.

Martin


